	<h2>Description</h2>
<p><strong>Bubble Wall with Logo at Kraft Tradeshow Booth – Las Vegas, Nevada<br />
</strong><br />
At a recent tradeshow in Las Vegas, Kraft partnered with Midwest-Tropical to make a lasting impression using a custom bubble wal<strong>l</strong> designed exclusively for their booth. Featuring a crisp logo and captivating blue lighting, this interactive water feature became a visual magnet—drawing attention and enhancing brand presence in a highly competitive event space.</p>
<p><strong>Key Features:</strong></p>
<p>– <strong>Eye-Catching Design</strong> – Bubble motion combined with brilliant blue LED lighting stops foot traffic in its tracks.<br />
– <strong>Branded Impact</strong> – A prominently displayed etched Kraft logo reinforces brand identity.<br />
– <strong>Compact &amp; Portable</strong> – Engineered for easy transport and setup—ideal for tradeshow environments.<br />
– <strong>High-Quality Construction</strong> – Crafted from commercial-grade acrylic and stainless steel for repeat use.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>How to Get a Custom Bubble Wall for Your Next Event</strong></p>
<p><strong>Talk to Midwest-Tropical</strong> – Begin with a conversation about your brand, space, and goals.<br />
<strong>Customize Your Feature</strong> – Select size, lighting, flow style, and branding elements.<br />
<strong>See a Digital Preview</strong> – CAD drawings help visualize the final setup.<br />
<strong>Enjoy Full-Service Support</strong> – From concept to on-site setup, Midwest-Tropical handles it all.</p>
<p>Call 1-623-323-4340 or toll-free 1-888-365-2393 to get started.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Customization Options</strong></p>
<p><strong>Size &amp; Shape</strong><br />
– Tailored to booth dimensions, available in wall-mounted, freestanding, or tabletop formats.</p>
<p><strong>Branding</strong><br />
– Add logos, taglines, or product imagery via etching or digital overlays.</p>
<p><strong>Lighting Effects</strong><br />
– RGB LEDs with multiple modes to match your color scheme or cycle through dynamic hues.</p>
<p><strong>Bubble Control</strong><br />
– Adjustable flow speeds and custom bubble patterns for added visual appeal.</p>
<p><strong>Material Finishes</strong><br />
– Sleek clear acrylic, brushed stainless steel, or custom-themed backdrops.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Installation Process</strong></p>
<ol>
<li><strong> Consultation &amp; Planning</strong><br />
Discuss event needs, booth layout, and brand messaging with the Midwest-Tropical team.</li>
<li><strong> CAD Design Phase</strong><br />
Receive professional renderings and finish samples for approval.</li>
<li><strong> Custom Fabrication</strong><br />
Engineered for durability, visual impact, and travel-readiness.</li>
<li><strong> Event Setup</strong><br />
Expert setup support ensures a flawless presentation at your tradeshow or expo.</li>
</ol>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Stand Out at Your Next Event</strong></p>
<p>Contact Midwest-Tropical at 1-623-323-4340 or toll-free 1-888-365-2393.</p>
<p><strong>Design to Impress</strong> – Explore size, style, and branded customization options.<br />
<strong>Request a Quote</strong> – Clear pricing, timelines, and logistics for your event.</p>
<p>The Bubble Wall with Logo at Kraft’s Las Vegas Tradeshow Booth shows how interactive water features can capture attention and elevate brand visibility in any expo setting. Let Midwest-Tropical bring your tradeshow experience to life.</p>
